    "reviewRhythm": "Revisit a standard across multiple texts and integrate it with related standards rather than treating one exposure as mastery.",
    "pacingNotes": "The source intentionally does not prescribe calendar pacing. Planning calendars are resources, while learner evidence decides repetition and next steps."
